<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Goodbye To a World (Live)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Porter Robinson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Secret Sky 2021 (Live)"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1864859263"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="235518886"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="chan-air"/></metadata></head><body dur="1:32.639"><div begin="31.562" end="1:32.639"><p begin="31.562" end="37.947" itunes:key="L0" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="31.562" end="32.528">Thank</span> <span begin="32.528" end="34.256">you,</span> <span begin="34.723" end="34.961">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="34.961" end="35.302">say</span> <span begin="35.302" end="35.682">good</span><span begin="35.682" end="36.622">bye</span> <span begin="36.622" end="37.947">soon</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">谢谢你 我很快就会道出离别</span></p><p begin="38.579" end="46.583" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="38.579" end="38.989">Though</span> <span begin="38.989" end="39.271">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="39.271" end="39.596">the</span> <span begin="39.596" end="39.948">end</span> <span begin="39.948" end="40.299">of</span> <span begin="40.299" end="40.576">the</span> <span begin="40.576" end="41.446">world,</span> <span begin="42.591" end="42.886">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="42.886" end="43.213">blame</span> <span begin="43.213" end="43.596">your</span><span begin="43.596" end="45.514">self,</span> <span begin="45.598" end="46.583">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即使这是世界的终结 也不要责备自己</span></p><p begin="46.968" end="57.476" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="46.968" end="47.175">And</span> <span begin="47.175" end="47.565">if</span> <span begin="47.565" end="48.421">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="48.421" end="50.125">true,</span> <span begin="50.545" end="50.843">I</span> <span begin="50.843" end="51.156">will</span> <span begin="51.156" end="51.360">sur</span><span begin="51.360" end="52.490">round</span> <span begin="52.490" end="53.737">you</span> <span begin="53.894" end="54.181">and</span> <span begin="54.181" end="54.472">give</span> <span begin="54.472" end="54.768">life</span> <span begin="54.768" end="54.941">to</span> <span begin="54.941" end="55.453">a</span> <span begin="55.453" end="57.476">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果这是真实的 我会用臂弯将你环绕 为世界带去生机</span></p><p begin="58.820" end="1:01.432" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="58.820" end="59.051">That&apos;s</span> <span begin="59.051" end="59.411">our</span> <span begin="59.411" end="1:01.432">own</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那只属于我们彼此</span></p><p begin="1:03.443" end="1:09.647" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:03.443" end="1:04.201">Thank</span> <span begin="1:04.201" end="1:05.499">you,</span> <span begin="1:06.468" end="1:06.757">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:06.757" end="1:07.020">say</span> <span begin="1:07.020" end="1:07.422">good</span><span begin="1:07.422" end="1:08.288">bye</span> <span begin="1:08.288" end="1:09.647">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">谢谢你 现在 我就要说出再见</span></p><p begin="1:10.383" end="1:16.939" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:10.383" end="1:10.646">Though</span> <span begin="1:10.646" end="1:10.983">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:10.983" end="1:11.331">the</span> <span begin="1:11.331" end="1:11.688">end</span> <span begin="1:11.688" end="1:11.969">of</span> <span begin="1:11.969" end="1:12.317">the</span> <span begin="1:12.317" end="1:13.073">world,</span> <span begin="1:14.301" end="1:14.653">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:14.653" end="1:14.952">blame</span> <span begin="1:14.952" end="1:15.444">your</span><span begin="1:15.444" end="1:16.939">self</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即使这是世界的终结 也不要责备自己</span></p><p begin="1:18.623" end="1:28.748" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:18.623" end="1:18.932">And</span> <span begin="1:18.932" end="1:19.348">if</span> <span begin="1:19.348" end="1:20.205">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:20.205" end="1:21.570">true,</span> <span begin="1:22.304" end="1:22.558">I</span> <span begin="1:22.558" end="1:22.938">will</span> <span begin="1:22.938" end="1:23.385">sur</span><span begin="1:23.385" end="1:24.286">round</span> <span begin="1:24.286" end="1:25.114">you</span> <span begin="1:25.681" end="1:25.874">and</span> <span begin="1:25.874" end="1:26.264">give</span> <span begin="1:26.264" end="1:26.573">life</span> <span begin="1:26.573" end="1:26.813">to</span> <span begin="1:26.813" end="1:27.345">a</span> <span begin="1:27.345" end="1:28.748">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果这是真实的 我会用臂弯将你环绕 为世界带去生机</span></p><p begin="1:30.566" end="1:32.639" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:30.566" end="1:30.993">That&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:30.993" end="1:31.285">our</span> <span begin="1:31.285" end="1:32.639">own</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那便是曾经的我们</span></p></div></body></tt>